前雷达探测点前言：雷达失校准
Flag To Indicate If Alignment Out Of Spec";
CM_ SG_ 967 FRM_2_DetnHd_AlignmentNotDone "Front Radar Moudle_2_Detection Header_Alignment Not Done
前雷达探测点前言：雷达未校准
Flag To Indicate if Alignment Has Been Done or Not";
CM_ SG_ 967 FRM_2_DetnHd_SensorBlockage "Front Radar Moudle_2_Detection Header_Sensor Blockage
前雷达探测点前言：雷达被遮挡
Flag To Indicate If Sensor Is Blind Or Not";
CM_ SG_ 967 FRM_2_DetnHd_ObjDetFail "Front Radar Moudle_2_Detection Header_Object Detection Fail
前雷达探测点前言：雷达目标探测失效
Indicates An Error In The Object Detection System. This flag include all conditions that shall impact radar detection performance, like HWFailure, Misalignment, AlignmentNotDone, SensorBlockage, OutOfVoltage, OverTemperature, ReceivedCANTimeOut, ReceivedCANInvalid, RF-BoardNoWorking.";
CM_ SG_ 967 FRM_2_DetnHd_OutOfVoltage "Front Radar Moudle_2_Detection Header_Out Of Voltage
前雷达探测点前言：雷达电压超范围
Indicates An Error Of Over Or Under Voltage";
CM_ SG_ 967 FRM_2_DetnHd_OverTemperature "Front Radar Moudle_2_Detection Header_Over Temperature
前雷达探测点前言：雷达温度过高
Indicates An Error Of Over Temperature";
CM_ SG_ 967 FRM_2_DetnHd_ReceivedCANTimeOut "Front Radar Moudle_2_Detection Header_Received CAN Time Out
前雷达探测点前言：雷达接收CAN信号超时
Flag To Indicate If Received CAN Signal Time Out Or Not";
CM_ SG_ 967 FRM_2_DetnHd_ReceivedCANInvalid "Front Radar Moudle_2_Detection Header_Received CAN Invalid
前雷达探测点前言：雷达接收到无效CAN信号
Flag To Indicate If Received CAN Signal Invalid Or Not";
CM_ SG_ 967 FRM_2_DetnHd_RFBoardWorkingSts "Front Radar Moudle_2_Detection Header_Radial Frequency Board Working Status
前雷达探测点前言：雷达射频板工作状态
Flag To Indicate Sensor RF Board Working Or Not. This flag shall set to 0x1 NoWokring only when RF Board power cutted off via UDS command actively. RF Board failure shall not set this flag.";
CM_ SG_ 967 FRM_2_DetnHd_ValidDetnCount "Front Radar Moudle_2_Detection Header_Valid Detection Count
前雷达探测点前言：雷达有效探测点数量
number of detected VALID Objects that have been sent to the bus";
CM_ SG_ 967 FRM_2_DetnHd_DetnDownSel "Front Radar Moudle_2_Detection Header_Detection Down Select
前雷达探测点前言：雷达探测点输出达到上限
the detected number of objects exceeded the number of max. objects that can be transmitted";
CM_ SG_ 967 FRM_2_DetnHd_DetnTimeStamp "Front Radar Moudle_2_Detection Header_Detection Time Stamp
前雷达探测点前言：探测点的时间戳
Captured time of object based on local time base of FRM which is synchronized by global time periodically";
CM_ SG_ 967 FRM_2_DetnHd_DetnTimeStampSts "Front Radar Moudle_2_Detection Header_Detection Time Stamp Status
前雷达探测点前言：探测点时间戳状态
Autosar StbM_TimeBaseStatusType bitfield
Bit 0: TIMEOUT
Bit 1: SYNC_TO_GATEWAY
Bit 2: GLOBAL_TIME_BASE
Bit 3: TIMELEAP_FUTURE
Bit 4: TIMELEAP_PAST";
CM_ SG_ 967 FRM_2_DetnHd_DetnTimeLatency "Front Radar Moudle_2_Detection Header_Detection Time Latency
前雷达探测点前言：探测点时间延迟
Sensor latency from object capture scene to object transmission";
CM_ SG_ 967 FRM_2_DetnHd_NotConfigured "Front Radar Moudle_2_Detection Header_Not Configured
前雷达探测点前言：雷达未配置
Flag To Indicate If Radar Configured Or Not";
CM_ SG_ 967 FRM_2_DetnHd_ParameterInvalid "Front Radar Moudle_2_Detection Header_Parameter Invalid
前雷达探测点前言：雷达参数无效
