CM_ SG_ 582 PDC_1_STATSensorState "0x0:Sensor normal
0x1:FOL sensor error
0x2:FML sensor error
0x4:FMR sensor error
0x8:FOR sensor error
0x10:FSR sensor error
0x20:RSR sensor error
0x40:ROR sensor error
0x80: RMR sensor error
0x100:RML sensor error
0x200:ROL sensor error
0x400:RSL sensor error
0x800:FSL sensor error";
