CM_ SG_ 1231 AVP_FuncReq "代客泊车功能请求
AVP function request";
CM_ SG_ 1231 FBLPowerHold "刷写挡位保持状态
OTA status
0x0:刷写档位保持请求信号无效
0x1:刷写档位保持请求信号有效
0x2:Reserved
0x3:Invalid";
CM_ SG_ 1199 TCM_1_TrailerSts "Trailer Status send by TCM. Vehicle can use this information to turn off/on some assistance like 'Park Distance Control'. Furthermore it might be used to turn off the fog light on the vehicle when a trailer is connected (at least in germany, there is a law saying that the vehicles fog lamp must not be turned on when a trailer is connected - only the fog of the trailer should be turned on).";
